# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in the real value.
#
# Google requires a client_secret on the OAuth token exchange even for "Desktop app"
# clients using PKCE. It is not a true secret in that context (it ships inside the
# installed app), but it must not be committed here: this repo is public, and GitHub
# secret scanning reports Google client secrets, after which Google revokes them.
#
# Find it at: Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
#             -> your OAuth 2.0 Client ID -> Client secret
MAIN_VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
